  "description": "The device in question is a Cisco Catalyst\u202f9500, serial number\u202fFTX1234ABCD. It has been classified with the tags \u201ccore,\u201d \u201cdatacenter,\u201d and \u201clayer3\u201d to reflect its role in the network infrastructure.\n\nInterface\u202fGigabitEthernet0/0 is an Ethernet port configured with the management address\u202f10.0.0.1, while TenGigabitEthernet1/0/1 is also an Ethernet port carrying the uplink address\u202f192.168.10.1. Both of these IPs (10.0.0.1 and 192.168.10.1) are listed as the router IPs for this chassis."
